    "Dispatch dimensions, storage formats, sampler combination and push constants follow the engine allocations.",
    "Blue-noise tables and fixed spatial offsets preserve the reference sampling sequences.",
    "Manual ray-query and Rust compute ports are listed separately; GPU comparison is recorded in kiln/docs/KAJIYA-PARITY.md and is not a claim of bitwise equality.",
    "Surfel irradiance follows the reference in-place transport schedule. GPU work ordering makes repeated runs non-bitwise-deterministic; compare repeated runs of both renderers."
